AcceptGrant_Vesting_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the grant does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownGrant
├── when the caller is not the shareholder
│   └── it should revert with OnlyShareholder
├── when the grant was already accepted
│   └── it should revert with GrantExists
├── when the offer has expired
│   └── it should revert with OfferExpired
├── when the terms hash is not the document hash
│   └── it should revert with TermsMismatch
├── when the shareholder already has a live grant on this class
│   └── it should revert with GrantExists
├── when the shareholder holds fewer unlocked shares than the amount
│   └── it should revert with NotEnoughShares
└── when the shareholder accepts the exact terms in time
    ├── it should mark the grant accepted
    ├── it should set the shareholder's live grant on the class
    ├── it should lock by the grant's schedule from now on
    └── it should emit GrantAccepted
